<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="site-container section grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1 class="display mt-3">A Mumbai firm built around people and work</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-5">
        PRANAM Consultancy Service Pvt Ltd was founded around 2025 by Prashant Chavan & Poonam Phatak. From Mumbai, Maharashtra, we support organisations with recruitment, staffing, payroll, compliance, and broader workforce requirements.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Our work is straightforward: understand what a business needs, understand what a candidate is looking for, and coordinate a hiring process that is careful, practical, and respectful of both.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=80"
      alt="Team conversation in a contemporary office"
      class="h-96 w-full rounded-card object-cover"
    />
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="site-container grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="card">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Our purpose</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">Help companies build dependable teams and help professionals find roles with genuine fit.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">How we work</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">Listen first, map the requirement, source with care, and stay present through joining.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Where we work</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">Headquartered in Mumbai, with pan-India service capability across industries and workforce types.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="site-container grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="rounded-card bg-surface-mint p-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-green-dark">Portrait placeholder</p>
      <p class="mt-24 font-display text-2xl text-ink"><%= site.founder %></p>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Founder</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="display">Leadership</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Prashant Chavan leads the organisation with a focus on reliable manpower consulting — from permanent and temporary staffing to payroll, compliance, and recruitment process support. The firm’s identity is practical rather than promotional: people, process, and long-term working relationships.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

